    coverage={"geography": "not recorded (web-published; the research page lists venues in Sydney, Paris, MIT and DAC)", "period": "a critic quoted on the project's research page dates the cycle 2010 to 2016; How It Is in Common Tongues 2012; the Leonardo paper August 2011"},
